					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The conclusion of the Mobile Task Force Rho-19 (&quot;Cythereans&quot;) story is now up. Once again, my thanks to my teammates <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/von-pincier" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1315056&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1457340652" alt="Von Pincier" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1315056)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/von-pincier" >Von Pincier</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1457340652" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" >minmin</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1457340652" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span> for their help in setting the story behind this piece.</p> <p>Now that this is finished, allow me to say to my team that you all did a fantastic job. I'm proud to have worked with each of you.</p> <p>Good luck to all of the other contest entrants.</p> 
				 	]]>
